{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven slide puzzle adventure in a land of magic and mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanted Valley: Fantasy Slide Puzzle invites you on a relaxing yet enchanting journey through a handcrafted pixel art world. Solve classic sliding puzzles and uncover the tale of Valkyria, a young druid chosen to protect her homeland from a growing darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869030/extras/c3f081215001a9afa6f53356ce1d1588.avif?t=1756708098\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Magical Story Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the enchanted world of the valley as you piece together 30 unique pixel art scenes \u2014 each revealing a part of Valkyria\u2019s story. From forest shrines to shadowy caves, every level brings new discoveries in this cozy, narrative-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Your Way Through the Valley</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve sliding puzzles in 4x4, 6x6, and 8x8 for increasing challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 4 different puzzle types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 handcrafted story levels with charming pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique game modes to unlock and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven gameplay told through puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing fantasy music and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual-friendly design - perfect for relaxing puzzle sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Valkyria\u2019s journey. Restore the valley\u2019s magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","back